## 2. [SPEC-60] init 이 allowlist 무력화를 고지하는가 (스펙 §12)
### 수정 전 (HEAD~1)
$ harness init   (stdout+stderr 전량)
.harness/ initialised — run `harness --help` to see the command map.
  → allowlist 고지 없음

### 수정 후 (HEAD)
$ harness init   (stdout+stderr 전량)
.harness/ initialised — run `harness --help` to see the command map.
NOTE: do not add `harness gate approve` to your permission allowlist. The gate relies on the permission dialog so that the final approval click is always a human — allowlisting it lets an agent open gates on its own.

$ harness init 2>/dev/null   # stdout 계약이 깨지지 않는지 (고지는 stderr)
