    ✅ deny   Write src/app.ts
    ✅ deny   echo > src/a.ts
    ❌ allow  echo >| src/a.ts (noclobber)
    ❌ allow  echo >|src/a.ts (공백없음)
    ✅ deny   heredoc > src/a.ts
    ✅ deny   heredoc quoted
    ✅ deny   heredoc <<-
    ✅ deny   cat > f <<EOF (순서 반대)
    ✅ deny   touch
    ✅ deny   sed -i
    ✅ deny   cp
    ✅ deny   mv
    ✅ deny   tee
    ✅ deny   tee -a
    ✅ deny   1> fd 명시
    ✅ deny   >> 추가
    ✅ deny   ln -s
    ❌ allow  python open()
  (b) .harness 코어 파일  (기대: deny)
    ✅ deny   Write state.json
    ✅ deny   >> events.jsonl (저널 위조)
    ❌ allow  >| events.jsonl
    ✅ deny   python open(events)
    ✅ deny   rm events.jsonl
    ✅ deny   truncate state.json
  (c) --force 자기해제  (기대: deny)
    ✅ deny   harness phase set --force
    ✅ deny   ./bin/harness phase set --force
  (d) 의도적 허용 — 과차단이면 사람이 하네스를 끈다  (기대: allow)
